&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You drive the day-to-day coordination of complex audits, examinations, and remediation tracking across Information Security, ICT risk, TPRM, and operational resilience. You will manage the end-to-end lifecycle of evidence collection, ensuring every request, decision, and finding remains perfectly traceable and audit-ready. By supporting domain owners and executing a highly controlled intake process, you will ensure our leadership has timely, accurate information for critical decisions and risk escalation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement &amp;amp; Evidence Workflow Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate the daily intake process for new engagements and evidence requests. Coordinate directly with domain and control owners to collect, organize, and quality-check evidence for completeness and version control against agreed internal deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Portfolio Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the centralized audit calendar, engagement register, and findings inventory. Ensure precise tracking of scope, owners, requests, dependencies, and current status across all regulatory and internal assurance activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Auditor-Facing Preparation:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare high-quality evidence packs, response trackers, meeting agendas, action logs, and status reporting. Ensure all submissions to auditors, regulators, and management are accurate, secure, and properly approved by domain owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remediation Tracking &amp;amp; Control Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Track remediation plans and final closure evidence, identifying overdue or incomplete actions early. Partner with control-testing teams to coordinate the reuse of relevant evidence and proactively escalate delivery risks to the Audit Management Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization &amp;amp; Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Administer the agreed workflow within existing GRC, ticketing, and collaboration tools. Consistently apply the audit-governance process while identifying safe opportunities to automate repetitive administrative work and reduce avoidable evidence rework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–7 years of relevant experience in audit coordination, technology risk, information security GRC, regulatory compliance, control assurance, or structured programme management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing competing deadlines, handling sensitive information with sound judgement, and confidently following up with cross-functional stakeholders to drive action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of audit evidence standards, control documentation, and the findings management lifecycle within a regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of DORA, ISO 27001, SOC 2, or third-party risk management is highly beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization, attention to detail, and written communication in professional English (German is beneficial), with the ability to maintain highly reliable records and response trackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Flexibility to work where you thrive&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy the freedom of our Hybrid working model, combining onsite collaboration and remote work, with an additional 25 days per year to work from a city or country of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Reward for your impact&lt;/strong&gt; – Receive a competitive total compensation package aligned with Bitpanda’s pay-for-impact policy, including participation in our stock option plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Support for your mental wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt; – Access confidential coaching, counselling, and mental health resources whenever you need them through OpenUP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge&lt;/strong&gt; – On top of your standard annual leave, prioritise your wellbeing in 2027 with 3 additional days of paid time off to rest, reset, and recharge, available once you’ve been with us for 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Grow your skills and stay ahead in your career with unlimited access to Udemy’s library of online courses at your own pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Exclusive perks and rewards&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy discounts, rewards, and perks from partners worldwide across lifestyle, wellness, tech, and travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Support during life milestones&lt;/strong&gt; – Take advantage of up to 8 additional weeks of gender-neutral new parent leave to welcome and bond with your new addition to the family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Fuel and focus on-site&lt;/strong&gt; – Pandas in Vienna, Bucharest, Barcelona, and Berlin can enjoy free onsite dining, with freshly prepared lunches and snacks to keep you fueled and focused all day long.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Recognition for your contributions&lt;/strong&gt; – Celebrate milestones and achievements with recognition and rewards for your Tenure at Bitpanda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Show your Bitpanda pride&lt;/strong&gt; – Access exclusive Bitpanda-branded merchandise and gear to represent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Connect and celebrate with your team&lt;/strong&gt; – Join unforgettable company events, from our Winter Party in Vienna to gatherings worldwide, fostering fun, connection, and celebration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;.…and even more location-specific benefits designed to make life at Bitpanda even more rewarding wherever you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, you will have the opportunity to learn and grow as part of Bitpanda’s incredible journey towards being Europe’s future #1 investment platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bitpanda is committed to fostering a fair and equal environment based on trust and mutual respect. We believe that a diverse and inclusive workplace is paramount to our success and we are committed to building a team that represents a wide variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;* These benefits may be adjusted at Bitpanda’s discretion and do not apply to our internships and exceptions to our Hybrid Working policy apply to teams with shift schedules or for folks whose roles require them to be in-office (think: Workplaces team or IT).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Title: Tech Lead&lt;br&gt;Department: Engineering&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Summary&lt;br&gt;As a Tech Lead at CreateFuture, you will use your technical and leadership skills to lead&lt;br&gt;and support diverse client projects. Depending on the engagement, this includes&lt;br&gt;hands-on coding, software architecture, solution design or delivery leadership and project&lt;br&gt;management, ensuring a high standard of delivery in everything we do.&lt;br&gt;We focus on high-value, high-impact client outcomes, and we’re not afraid to challenge&lt;br&gt;the status quo. You should be curious, pragmatic, and operate well in ambiguous&lt;br&gt;environments.&lt;br&gt;As a technology consultancy, it’s important for us to not only deliver reliable, scalable&lt;br&gt;solutions but to be looking at future trends and other high-impact developments. Your&lt;br&gt;curiosity for technology and its application to business opportunities is highly valued&lt;br&gt;within the company. We are disrupting consultancy through the use of Artificial&lt;br&gt;Intelligence and radical thinking in our approach. We&#39;re doing something different, and&lt;br&gt;that’s realising significant benefits for our clients. We want you to share that same&lt;br&gt;ambition.&lt;br&gt;You will also manage a team of technical direct reports, who are themselves working on&lt;br&gt;client projects, for whom you will provide actionable feedback, technical guidance and&lt;br&gt;mentoring, fostering a continuous improvement, growth and consultancy mindset.&lt;br&gt;You will work with clients at every level to understand their problems, set expectations,&lt;br&gt;and maximise business value, representing CreateFuture as an engagement lead.&lt;br&gt;Role Requirements&lt;br&gt;● Proven, hands-on technical leader delivering complex software.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrate thought-leadership; supporting our clients and colleagues to&lt;br&gt;understand, through modern technology and process, what is possible for their&lt;br&gt;business/craft.&lt;br&gt;● Line-manage a team of engineers while maintaining personal delivery&lt;br&gt;contributions.&lt;br&gt;● Commercial experience in at least one: Java, .NET, Python, or TypeScript (backend&lt;br&gt;or frontend).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial experience with at least one major cloud (Amazon Web Services,&lt;br&gt;Microsoft Azure, or Google Cloud Platform) and modern infrastructure practices&lt;br&gt;(containers, continuous integration/continuous delivery, infrastructure as code).&lt;br&gt;● Strong delivery fundamentals: estimation, planning, and risk/issue/dependency&lt;br&gt;management; escalates early with clear options and impacts.&lt;br&gt;● Communicate designs and trade-offs clearly to technical and non-technical&lt;br&gt;stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;● Skilled in difficult conversations and actionable feedback; sets clear standards and&lt;br&gt;holds people accountable.&lt;br&gt;Desirable:&lt;br&gt;● Tailor ways of working (Scrum or Kanban) to context and drive continuous&lt;br&gt;improvement.&lt;br&gt;● Experience in change transformation projects that involved significant Artificial&lt;br&gt;Intelligence adoption.&lt;br&gt;● Breadth across multiple languages or disciplines (e.g., Rust, test automation,&lt;br&gt;DevOps/platform engineering).&lt;br&gt;● Experience across multiple clouds and cloud-native services.&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to recruitment and pre-sales in a consultancy context.&lt;br&gt;● Represent CreateFuture in the external tech community.&lt;br&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Communicate designs, trade‐offs, and constraints in the context of client goals.&lt;br&gt;● Lead architecture, solution design, and documentation; make pragmatic&lt;br&gt;technology choices.&lt;br&gt;● Contribute code where appropriate; set engineering standards; ensure reviews,&lt;br&gt;testing, and maintainability.&lt;br&gt;● Troubleshoot complex issues; drive root‐cause fixes and follow‐up actions.&lt;br&gt;Delivery leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Own technical outcomes: scope, estimate, plan, and track to agreed goals.&lt;br&gt;● Highlight risks, issues, and dependencies; escalate early with clear options,&lt;br&gt;impacts, and recommendations.&lt;br&gt;● Ensure actionable backlogs and realistic plans; communicate timelines and team&lt;br&gt;shape needs.&lt;br&gt;People leadership (enable, unblock, hold to account):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Guide direct reports to set themselves clear personal goals, and hold them&lt;br&gt;accountable for realising them.&lt;br&gt;● Proactively remove impediments across technical, process, and organisational&lt;br&gt;boundaries.&lt;br&gt;● Hold colleagues accountable for commitments and standards; address&lt;br&gt;performance issues promptly.&lt;br&gt;● Provide targeted guidance and feedback; recognise achievements.&lt;br&gt;● Line‐manage direct reports; run core rituals (team meetings, 1:1s, objectives,&lt;br&gt;reviews).&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to hiring.&lt;br&gt;Client leadership:&lt;br&gt;● Build trusted relationships at all levels; translate business needs into technical&lt;br&gt;plans.&lt;br&gt;● Manage expectations and scope; articulate value and trade‐offs; identify follow‐on&lt;br&gt;opportunities.&lt;br&gt;● Represent CreateFuture as the engagement lead.&lt;br&gt;Optional/community:&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to delivery practices and standards&lt;br&gt;● Contribute to pre‐sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une agence de publicité, de marketing et de communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy est une des filiales du Groupe WPP, ce qui fait de nous la plus internationale de toutes les agences de communication françaises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;David Ogilvy, notre fondateur, a un parcours atypique et peu scolaire. Entrepreneur dans l’âme, c’est son travail, son talent et sa vision qui lui ont permis de devenir l’un des plus grands communicants des années 60. Il a, d’ailleurs, beaucoup inspiré la série Mad Men.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il a fondé la maison Ogilvy en 1948, en plein cœur de New-York avant de se développer aux États-Unis et à l’international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En plus d’avoir bâti un empire, il a aussi réussi à transcender notre vision des produits, des marques et notre façon de les raconter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;70 ans plus tard, nous continuons de transmettre son héritage avec un seul but : « &lt;em&gt;Making brands matter ».&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA DREAM TEAM &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Créative et sous la responsabilité du Directeur de Création, &lt;strong&gt;tu travailleras aux côtés de directeurs artistiques et de créatifs confirmés qui t&#39;accompagneront dans ton développement. &lt;/strong&gt;Tu participeras à la conception et à la réalisation de projets créatifs 360°.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons avant tout un profil avec une vraie sensibilité artistique, un regard graphique affirmé et une forte appétence pour la création d&#39;images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À ce titre, tu auras pour missions :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer aux réunions de travail : briefs, moodboards, points créa, PPM, présentations clients, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer directement au processus de création sur plusieurs projets publicitaires : élaboration de campagnes print, TV, web, déclinaisons graphiques multi-supports, mises en page, identités visuelles, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Imaginer et développer des concepts visuels et des univers graphiques singuliers sur différents supports : key visuals, outdoor, brand content, social media, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explorer, proposer et développer des pistes artistiques, des partis pris graphiques, des références et des territoires iconographiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et réaliser des visuels en maîtrisant toute la chaîne de création : recherche, composition, génération d&#39;images par IA, retouche et finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérimenter les nouveaux outils d&#39;intelligence artificielle générative pour repousser les possibilités de création visuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts du stage :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu travailleras sur une très grande variété de grandes marques françaises et internationales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras impliqué(e) dans toutes les étapes de la création, de la recherche artistique à la réalisation des visuels, avec la possibilité d&#39;explorer de nouvelles approches créatives et de nouveaux outils.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
