&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Curiosity, creativity and a pragmatic approach to solving ambiguous business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
