&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlixPartners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AlixPartners, we solve the most complex and critical challenges by moving quickly from analysis to action — when it really matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create value that has a lasting impact on companies, their employees and their communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By understanding, respecting and acknowledging the needs of our employees, clients and communities, AlixPartners actively fosters an inclusive environment. We firmly believe in the value that diversity of experience brings, and we are committed to continuously improving our initiatives, policies and practices. We commit to creating space for authenticity, growth and equality for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AlixPartners has adopted a hybrid working model to offer flexibility and support our employees&#39; work-life integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role as Strategic Finance Business Partner (France), you can expect a fast-paced, hands-on position in finance, working with the local French Leadership on driving the country’s performance as well as with the wider strategic finance team for the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a trusted strategic finance partner to the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group, translating financial data into actionable insights and proactively challenging business decisions to support sustainable and profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In supporting the finance function, you will work closely with colleagues in accounting and other Corporate Services functions (HR, Legal, IT, Business Development, etc.) in our fast-moving, rapidly growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you are an experienced business partner with a strong customer focus and the ability to build and maintain interpersonal relationships. You will work closely with the French leadership team and the wider Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group and successfully handle demanding financial topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are joining at an exciting time and will help modernize the finance function and support the company&#39;s long-term success. This role plays an important part in our strong growth, and you will have the opportunity to help shape it and build your own finance career at AlixPartners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Finance Business Partner – France is a full-time position with hybrid working arrangements, based in our Paris office. The role reports to the EMEA Head of Strategic Finance. Your responsibilities also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive coordination with the French Country Leader and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners to provide financial expertise and support, focusing on company growth, improving profitability and strengthening working capital management to reduce DSOs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting as a trusted advisor to senior leadership, offering proactive financial insights, recommendations and constructive challenge on key business and operational decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparation and ownership of annual budgets and monthly forecasting processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting business planning and capacity planning, including financial analysis to improve resource allocation and profitable revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Providing the financial resources needed to ensure strategic business development, client retention and increased client profitability within country, service and industry groups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Close collaboration with the engagement analyst team to ensure a continuous flow of information on project-related challenges, or specific issues, and to support their resolution and discussion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying revenue risks arising from significant working capital or engagement challenges and responding appropriately&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting the Managing Director &amp;amp; Partner group on the running of their projects, including pricing, project set-up, WIP and AR management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively challenging stakeholders on engagement economics, fee structures, profitability and financial risks, and driving appropriate corrective actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preparing the monthly financial management information (MI), including insightful commentary and analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing and implementing dashboards, KPIs and regular performance-review routines across clients, engagements and Managing Director &amp;amp; Partners, translating analysis into clear business recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitoring performance against long-term strategic and short-term operational plans and supporting the Country Leader in defining the measures needed to achieve agreed financial targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carrying out ad hoc analyses as needed to maximize profitability in terms of revenue and working capital&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in strategic finance, FP&amp;amp;A or finance business partnering with senior stakeholders, ideally in the professional services or consulting sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong foundation in accounting and financial controlling, combined with relevant professional experience; seniority and scope of experience will be assessed against the role requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced proficiency in MS Office, with a particular focus on Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to stay calm and focused under pressure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and organizational skills with great attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to influence and constructively challenge experienced stakeholders, including senior business leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with the ability to turn complex financial analyses into practical, actionable recommendations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive, hands-on, solutions-oriented mindset and the confidence to take ownership of financial performance topics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A mindset that prioritizes continuous improvement, supporting personal development, colleague development and the optimization of business processes and interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to grasp the big picture while considering company-wide implications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative team player who values transparency and takes a straightforward approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of SAP S/4 HANA Cloud, SAP Analytics Cloud (finance systems) or a similar ERP system for enterprise services is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to build a comprehensive understanding of the company over time and find new ways to expand value creation for our firm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a positive work environment, the company offers a comprehensive compensation package with an excellent performance program. AlixPartners is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, veteran status or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;FEQ228R125&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Specialist Solutions Architect (Sr. SSA) for AI/ML, you will be the go-to technical expert for Databricks&#39; AI platform across our customers. You will help them move from AI experiments to &lt;strong&gt;governed, cost-efficient agents and ML systems running on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with Account Executives and Solutions Architects to win strategic opportunities. You will design architectures for advanced agent and ML use cases and lead hands-on proofs of concept and MVPs. You will act as a trusted advisor to customer technical leaders on AI strategy, governance and economics. You will also shape our AI go-to-market in the region, enable the wider field team, and feed what you learn from customers back to Product and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Manager, Specialist Solutions Architects – Switzerland, Austria &amp;amp; Eastern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win the technical decision for AI on Databricks.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery, architecture design, demos, proofs of concept and MVPs for agent, GenAI and ML use cases in competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design production-grade agent systems.&lt;/strong&gt; Architect agents and multi-agent applications using Agent Bricks, Databricks Apps, MCP tools, Lakebase, AI Search and the Foundation Model APIs. Govern assets under Unity Catalog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make agent quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Help customers build evaluation and observability into everything they ship, using MLflow tracing, domain-specific LLM judges, labelled evaluation datasets, release gates and production monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern AI at enterprise scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Position the AI Gateway as the central control point for model access, guardrails, PII protection, usage tracking and rate limiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale your expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; Enable SAs and partners with workshops, reusable assets and reference architectures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence the product.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring structured customer feedback and requirements specific to the market to Product Management and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a visible voice.&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Databricks at customer executive briefings, meetups, conferences and in written content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in machine learning, AI engineering or data science, including customer-facing technical work (pre-sales, consulting or technical leadership).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of shipping LLM and agent systems to production&lt;/strong&gt;, not just prototypes, including evaluation, monitoring and cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of agent architecture: tool use and function calling, MCP, agent memory and state, orchestrating multiple agents, and retrieval and context design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical experience &lt;strong&gt;evaluating GenAI systems&lt;/strong&gt;: tracing, LLM-as-a-judge, building evaluation datasets, regression testing and observability in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with at least one modern agent framework (e.g. LangGraph, OpenAI Agents SDK, Google ADK, DSPy). You should be framework-agnostic in how you design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the foundation-model landscape (e.g. Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, open-weight models) and the trade-offs between quality, latency, cost and data residency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in classical ML and MLOps: model development, deployment, monitoring and lifecycle management at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills in Python and SQL. You use AI coding assistants (e.g. Claude Code, Cursor) daily and can build a working demo application quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure or GCP) and modern data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence technical leaders up to CTO/CDO level and to explain complex AI topics in business terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to communicate and teach complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;À propos de WPP Media&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le leader mondial des services de communication et de transformation créative pour les plus grandes marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est l&#39;unité opérationnelle média de WPP, réunissant médias, data, technologies et partenariats pour délivrer une personnalisation créative à grande échelle. Connectés via notre plateforme d&#39;IA marketing pionnière &lt;strong&gt;WPP Open&lt;/strong&gt; et alimentés par &lt;strong&gt;Open Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, nos collaborateurs permettent aux annonceurs de comprendre avec précision l&#39;impact et la performance de leurs investissements médias.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour des raisons de clarté et d&#39;accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l&#39;écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité des chances, en considérant l&#39;ensemble des candidatures sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique, de religion ou de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs fondamentales :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary :&lt;/strong&gt; Cultiver un leadership collectif qui inspire des idées transformatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer un équilibre fondé sur la confiance mutuelle, l&#39;écoute et l&#39;épanouissement des équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism :&lt;/strong&gt; Stimuler activement l&#39;apprentissage et le développement pour faire grandir l&#39;organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Le Rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l’entité &lt;strong&gt;Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics (DTA)&lt;/strong&gt; de WPP Media, vous rejoignez le pôle Consulting, une équipe agile dédiée à l&#39;accélération technologique et à la valorisation de la data au service des stratégies marketing de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Manager Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting&lt;/strong&gt;, vous jouez un rôle pivot à la croisée du conseil stratégique, de l&#39;avant-vente et de l&#39;innovation. Véritable pont entre les enjeux business des annonceurs et l&#39;expertise technique, votre mission est d&#39;écouter, diagnostiquer, vulgariser et prescrire les meilleures solutions data &amp;amp; tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous intervenez comme un partenaire stratégique de confiance auprès des directeurs marketing clients ainsi que des équipes conseil et expertises médias internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vos Missions Principales:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Diagnostic stratégique &amp;amp; Conseil client :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les besoins marketing et médias des clients (annonceurs nationaux et internationaux) et identifier leurs opportunités de transformation data (activation, mesure, attribution, qualification d&#39;audience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduire des diagnostics de maturité data et recommander des feuilles de route adaptées aux objectifs business des marques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vulgariser des concepts techniques complexes auprès d&#39;interlocuteurs non spécialistes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Avant-vente, Prescription &amp;amp; Développement d&#39;offres :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Détecter proactivement les opportunités de valorisation des expertises DTA auprès des équipes conseil de l&#39;agence et lors de briefs clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir les propositions de valeur adaptées en piochant dans le catalogue de solutions technologiques WPP (notamment la suite WPP Open et les agents IA) ou en élaborant des offres de conseil sur-mesure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger les propositions commerciales, cadrer les devis (temps de conseil, outils) et porter la soutenance en clientèle lors de pitchs et de rendez-vous stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Coordination transverse &amp;amp; Synergie technique :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la passerelle entre le besoin d&#39;affaires du client et les équipes techniques internes (Data Scientists, ingénieurs et développeurs de l&#39;équipe DTA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cadrer les projets en phase d&#39;initiation et veiller à ce que les solutions déployées répondent parfaitement aux attentes initiales de l&#39;annonceur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes d&#39;activation média (Search, Social, Display, Programmatique) pour interconnecter la data et la performance de campagne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Profil Recherché:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 5 à 8 ans d&#39;expérience dans une fonction de conseil data, de chef de projet digital/martech, de consultant avant-vente ou de stratégie média, idéalement acquise en cabinet de conseil digital, en agence média ou chez un acteur adtech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture Conseil &amp;amp; aisance relationnelle :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellentes capacités d&#39;écoute, de pédagogie et de conviction. Vous savez instaurer une relation de confiance avec des interlocuteurs de niveau Direction et porter un discours commercial à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Data &amp;amp; Marketing Digital :&lt;/strong&gt; Très bonne compréhension globale de l&#39;écosystème de la data publicitaire. Vous maîtrisez le vocabulaire sans avoir besoin de manipuler les outils techniques au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit de synthèse &amp;amp; présentation :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise avancée de la conception de présentations percutantes pour traduire des problématiques techniques en opportunités business concrètes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Français courant et pratique professionnelle fluide de l&#39;anglais à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral (échanges réguliers avec nos réseaux internationaux et certains clients paneuropéens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Avantages &amp;amp; vie chez WPP Media:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadre de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Un campus moderne et dynamique à Levallois-Perret, doté d&#39;espaces collaboratifs, d&#39;espaces extérieurs et de services de restauration d&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation du travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Politique hybride flexible (jusqu&#39;à 2 jours de télétravail par semaine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accès aux technologies de pointe :&lt;/strong&gt; Accès direct et formation aux innovations de pointe du groupe (suite WPP Open, solutions d&#39;IA générative).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement solidaire :&lt;/strong&gt; Possibilité de participer à des missions d&#39;intérêt général via notre programme &lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Processus de recrutement:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premier Contact (RH) :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange préliminaire téléphonique ou visio avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition pour faire le point sur votre parcours et vos attentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Métier :&lt;/strong&gt; Rencontre approfondie avec le Responsable du pôle Data &amp;amp; Tech Consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mise en situation &amp;amp; Entretien Direction :&lt;/strong&gt; Cas pratique axé sur la posture de conseil, la pédagogie et la compréhension business, suivi d&#39;un échange avec la Direction DTA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life-balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and personal collaboration in the office are central to us, but we also offer a regular remote work day for added flexibility. In addition, you can compensate for overtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on:&lt;/strong&gt; You receive 26 days of paid leave plus an additional 4 compensation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&lt;/strong&gt; Health benefits and dedicated Mental Health Awareness Days put your health and well-being front and center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow through our diverse training programs and leverage internal career initiatives for your personal development across the WPP network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job:&lt;/strong&gt; Look forward to unforgettable team events, exclusive employee discounts, and many more highlights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone is warmly welcome here – diversity and equal opportunities are at the core of who we are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is what you move:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager Client Media (m/f/d) on a fixed-term contract in Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;, you lead campaign strategy for a world-renowned luxury brand. You serve as the primary strategic advisor to the client, translating complex briefs into innovative, omnichannel media solutions. Working closely with our activation teams, you orchestrate tailored audience journeys and ensure strategic excellence from concept to execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Strategy Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Driving high-level media and communication strategies tailored to the standards and nuances of a premier luxury brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership &amp;amp; Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting as the primary client sparring partner for strategic inquiries, crafting compelling presentations, and delivering innovative solutions for every campaign brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience Journey &amp;amp; Messaging Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Defining comprehensive messaging journeys for priority target groups—orchestrating what to communicate, which narrative to use, optimal timing, and the most effective touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrated Cross-Channel Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborating with activation experts to design integrated strategies across all relevant media channels, including Digital, Social, Search, Print, and OOH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialist Briefing &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Translating approved strategic concepts into actionable, high-quality briefs for specialist activation teams (Social, Search, Offline) to ensure seamless operational execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; KPI Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Defining performance measurement frameworks, establishing relevant luxury-tier KPIs and benchmarks, and evaluating campaign effectiveness to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following qualities distinguish you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Agency Background:&lt;/strong&gt; At least five years of proven experience in campaign strategy, media consulting, or account management, ideally gained within an established media agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Luxury &amp;amp; Global Client Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of driving strategic initiatives for multinational accounts, preferably with deep exposure to the luxury or prestige goods sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omnichannel Media Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong holistic understanding of the full media landscape, seamlessly connecting digital ecosystems (social, search, programmatic) with premium offline environments (print, OOH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storytelling &amp;amp; Presentation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to turn complex consumer insights and data into elegant, inspiring client narratives and high-impact presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship &amp;amp; Partner Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive mindset with a natural talent for engaging diverse stakeholders, fostering trust, and building strong collaborative bridges between client teams and internal units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent English skills (written and spoken) are essential; French and/or German language skills are a valuable asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;#strategic-thinker #luxury-enthusiast #trusted-advisor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this job sounds exciting to you, we strongly encourage you to apply, even if you don&#39;t have every qualification listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our privacy policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for Germany, Austria and Switzerland for further information on how we process the data you provide. #LI-Promoted 14161&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ben jij de influencer-goeroe die wij zoeken?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Volg jij de nieuwste features op Instagram, TikTok, YouTube en Snapchat op de voet? Weet jij precies welke influencers op dit moment hot zijn? Beheers je zowel het Nederlands als het Engels vloeiend? Dan maken we graag kennis met je!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dochteronderneming van WPP, het wereldwijde advertisingconglomeraat. We ondersteunen toonaangevende mediabureaus zoals Wavemaker, Mindshare en EssenceMediacom. Binnen WPP Media zijn verschillende centrale activiteiten ondergebracht, waaronder StudioM, Digital Data Hub, Business Intelligence, Proces Management, Marketing Services &amp;amp; Insights, Trading en Quality Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dynamische, jonge en ambitieuze organisatie met duizenden (young) professionals wereldwijd. In Nederland hebben we kantoren in Amsterdam, Eindhoven en Sittard. Daar werken honderden collega’s voor toonaangevende klanten zoals Action, Lamb Weston, NS, Subway, M&amp;amp;M’s, Brabantia, IKEA en Dr. Oetker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ons kantoor in Amsterdam biedt een adembenemend uitzicht van 180 graden over de stad en de Amstel. De sfeer is informeel en gezellig, met regelmatig vrijdagmiddagborrels in onze skybar op de negende verdieping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over StudioM en de functie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je gaat aan de slag bij StudioM, ons interne bureau voor influencer marketing. We voeren campagnes uit op grote, vaak internationale schaal. Je werkt met een breed scala aan klanten, influencers en campagnes, waardoor geen dag hetzelfde is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deze rol draag je zelfstandig de operationele verantwoordelijkheid voor complexe en omvangrijke projecten. Denk aan multi-marketprojecten, strategische accounts, campagnes voor meerdere merken en innovatieve trajecten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projectmanagement: Je bent zelfstandig verantwoordelijk voor het opzetten, uitvoeren en coördineren van influencer marketingcampagnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning en voortgang: Je stuurt de dagelijkse uitvoering aan, maakt duidelijke projectplanningen en bewaakt deadlines, afhankelijkheden, prioriteiten en de voortgang van projecten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencerselectie en briefings: Je vertaalt de kaders en briefings van de accountmanager naar concrete selectielijsten, taken en creatieve briefings, waaronder influencerbriefings. Waar nodig verdeel je taken onder junior collega’s of stagiairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relatiebeheer en onderhandelingen: Je onderhoudt relaties met influencers en talentbureaus en onderhandelt zelfstandig over marktconforme vergoedingen binnen het vastgestelde budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgetbeheer en administratie: Je beheert projectbudgetten en houdt kosten bij, zoals influencer fees, buy-outs en event- en productiekosten. Ook verzorg je contracten en regel je boekingen met bureaus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content en kwaliteit: Je bewaakt de voortgang en kwaliteit van alle content en deliverables, voert eerste contentchecks uit en werkt nauw samen met accountmanagers richting definitieve goedkeuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Afstemming en rapportage: Je werkt samen met interne teams om effectieve campagnes te realiseren. Je houdt klanten, stakeholders en de accountmanager proactief op de hoogte van de dagelijkse voortgang, sluit waar nodig aan bij klantupdates en rapporteert over resultaten en aandachtspunten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risicobeheersing en optimalisatie: Je signaleert risico’s, knelpunten en optimalisatiemogelijkheden, bespreekt deze met de (senior) accountmanager en escaleert tijdig waar nodig. Je stuurt actief bij, optimaliseert lopende campagnes en voert verbeteringen door met medior- en juniorcollega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluatie en begeleiding: Je levert inhoudelijke input voor projectevaluaties, vertaalt learnings naar verbeteringen voor toekomstige campagnes en begeleidt en werkt stagiairs in binnen het team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng je mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een passie voor influencer marketing en leeft social media. Je kijkt liever YouTube en TikTok dan televisie en denkt in Instagram Stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt de nieuwste features en ontwikkelingen op socialmediaplatformen en weet welke influencers op dit moment relevant zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je begrijpt hoe platformen als Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok en Snapchat werken en houdt hun innovaties bij.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent creatief, maar werkt ook gestructureerd en gecoördineerd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheerst het Nederlands en Engels vloeiend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ jaar ervaring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent hands-on en zorgt ervoor dat campagnes tot in de puntjes geregeld zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een boeiende baan in een vooruitstrevend en informeel team binnen een van de grootste communicatiegroepen ter wereld. Je krijgt de mogelijkheid om je talenten verder te ontwikkelen in een inspirerende werkomgeving. En natuurlijk werk je met fijne collega’s in ons geweldige kantoor, die iedere werkdag bijzonder maken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaris: €3.800 - €5.800&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(op basis van 38,75 uur per week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toegang tot M Academy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voor uitgebreide trainingen en workshops in zowel hard als soft skills, inclusief specifieke AI-trainingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken voor grote (internationale) merken en klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een zelfstandige rol met veel vrijheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De kans om een breder perspectief binnen influencer marketing en social media te ontwikkelen en kennis vanuit de wereld van mediabureaus op te doen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken binnen een energiek, ambitieus en gezellig team met focus op AI-transformatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open communicatie en een fijne werksfeer waarin iedereen zichzelf kan zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede arbeidsvoorwaarden en ontwikkelmogelijkheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een fijne kantoorplek op een mooie locatie in Amsterdam (Rivierenbuurt);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een team met veel kennis, kunde en gezelligheid;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vrijdagmiddag borrels en events op onze rooftop aan de Amstel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Toegang tot ons well being platform Telus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reiskostenvergoeding:&lt;/strong&gt; Reiskosten worden volledig vergoed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8% vakantiegeld en 26 vakantiedagen per jaar&lt;/strong&gt; (plus 9 extra bij te kopen!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; €30 netto per maand bij fulltime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Own Device (BYOD):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je ontvangt een maandelijkse telefoonvergoeding van €57,50 netto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaar voor de volgende stap in je carrière?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solliciteer nu en word onderdeel van ons ambitieuze team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Development Representative (ADR) at Samsara, you will be trained — both on the job and through formal programs led by a world-class Sales team — to take on your next role as a closing Account Executive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a daily basis, you will build and work a portfolio of target accounts for our EMEA business in France: researching each account for commercial signal, prioritising which contacts to approach and in what order, and running a connected, multi-touch outbound motion that generates qualified pipeline rather than one-off meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates based in France and the United Kingdom. This position requires working hours in CET. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world:&lt;/strong&gt; your efforts will result in real-world impact — helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career:&lt;/strong&gt; if you put in the work, this role won&#39;t be your last at Samsara. Successful ADRs can see promotion to a closing role in two years or less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited by AI:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll use cutting-edge AI tools every day and sell some of the most advanced AI in the physical operations space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You think several moves ahead:&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;d rather build a real relationship across an account than force a single contact to a decision they&#39;re not ready to make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an innate curiosity about how businesses work:&lt;/strong&gt; one day you&#39;ll be researching a transport operator, the next a food distribution centre. Our best reps dig into the businesses they support to make a sharper case for why Samsara matters to them specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You treat rejection as a learning experience:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role you will get hung up on and told no. You need the resilience to prepare, call again, and adjust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; Samsara&#39;s high-performance Sales culture means you&#39;ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go further than you have before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research target accounts before outreach — pulling commercial signal out of public information (financials, news, hiring activity, compliance or safety pressure) to build a specific, defensible point of view on where Samsara adds value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and prioritise an account-level contact plan, identifying who to approach first across a range of stakeholders (e.g. MD, Operations/Transport Manager, Compliance/H&amp;amp;S, Finance) and being able to justify that choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a connected, multi-touch outbound motion across phone, email and LinkedIn — using early conversations to gather information and multi-thread the account, not just to book a meeting at any cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write personalised, researched outreach (including cold emails) that carries a specific point of view into every call, rather than working from a generic script.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read what a contact gives you on the call and adapt in real time — including recognising when the right move is to gather information and position a follow-up with someone else, rather than push for a meeting the contact can&#39;t actually commit to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep meticulous account and contact records in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a product expert and represent the Samsara brand at trade shows and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years professional experience, ideally in customer-facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 months&amp;nbsp; experience in a sales or equivalent target driven role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and committed, with a strong desire to work in target-driven sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently meeting or exceeding targets in previous roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, and able to ask insightful questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A champion of a Growth Mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in English and fluent in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI literacy and ability to showcase examples of leveraging AI in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort turning unstructured information (an annual report, a website, a news article) into a clear commercial argument&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience multi-threading or navigating multiple stakeholders within a single sale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine willingness to prepare — to research and write — before a call, rather than relying on improvising well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in closing-sales roles or similar target driven environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of achievement beyond work (e.g. academics, sports, charity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to collaborate and influence in a &quot;win as a team&quot; environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement about solving new problems in innovative ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to help build a fast-growing business in the IoT and SaaS space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR pathways&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through Samsara&#39;s ADR program, there are always opportunities to move to the next level and take on more responsibility. With emphasis on continued professional development, training doesn&#39;t stop after onboarding — we provide opportunities to expand ADRs&#39; understanding of the market and competitors, develop hard skills, and work with mentors to progress through three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR I&lt;/strong&gt; — focus on inbound leads: a high volume of conversations, sharing the ins and outs of our products, and fostering relationships with interested prospects. Learning opportunities include call sessions with senior Sales team members, tool training (Salesforce, Salesloft, Lusha), product knowledge, and objection handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR II&lt;/strong&gt; — work on top-of-funnel movement, creating high-quality sales engagements, and supporting Account Executives. Enrolled in specialised training including professional writing, persona-based messaging, cold calling 2.0, and AE collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR III&lt;/strong&gt; — work hand-in-hand with field Account Executives and Enterprise Regional Sales Managers. Partner on large accounts, implement territory plans, join weekly strategy meetings, and schedule/attend customer demos, alongside a mentorship program ahead of an AE interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please submit an English CV with your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure France (formerly Pure Storage) is looking for an Account Executive to win new business across strategic commercial accounts in France, with a focus on managed service providers (MSPs), cloud providers, IT services firms and system integrators. The role is based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will open doors in targeted accounts, build your own pipeline, and grow our footprint with customers and channel partners. You will work closely with Sales, Pre-sales, Partner Sales and Field Marketing to bring our all-flash enterprise storage solutions to the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new customers by prospecting into service provider and IT services accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build account plans and lead the pursuit team on key opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with channel resellers, GSI and ecosystem partners to position Everpure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lasting relationships with providers and grow with them as their own customer base grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present clear proposals that show business value and technical differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed your quota with a healthy, well-qualified pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success winning new business in direct and indirect sales, including prospecting into new accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of meeting or exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to MSPs, IT services firms or integrators, and with channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading infrastructure conversations with technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling storage, infrastructure or IT solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud, hosting, data center or IT services markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with GSI or ecosystem partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
